  "name": "bhutan-roads",
  "notes": "These datasets provide the delimitation of highways, feeder and farm roads in Bhutan.\r\n\r\nThe road dataset was created in 2008 by the GoB National Land Commission and obtained from the [Bhutan Geospatial Portal](http://www.geo.gov.bt/) in May 2015 and includes road surface information and road names where known.\r\n\r\nThis dataset can be complemented by the OSM dataset that includes several additional roads in the north east.",
